 * 
 * @section streaming_class_diag_summary Summary
 * 
 * Streaming class diagram shows class inheritance hierarchy, dependencies and associations of each unique
 * streaming class implementation.
 * 
 * Each unique streaming class implements custom data gathering, processing and transmission procedures.
 * Each unique straming class utilizes the virtual DMA interface for high bandwidth data transfering and 
 * ``ISerialPort`` interface for device stream control and parameter configuration. Virtual interface
 * implementations depend on devices, that created the streaming object.
 * 
 * All implementations of streaming classes utilize a universal stream interface  ``RFStream``.
 * 
 * @subsection streaming_class_diag_legend Diagram legend
 * 
 * Link definitions:
 * 
 * - Solid line with a transparet arrow head body - Inheritance
 * - Dotted line with simple arrow head - Dependency
 * - Solid line with simple arrow head - Association
 * 
 */